[[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3025915\">7055B54</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025960\">7210E10</a></p><p>1. Unscrew the bolts</p><p>2. Remove the shield.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2005452.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<p>1. If necessary, take off panels (1a) by undoing retainers (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2005453.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the shield is undamaged.</p><p>If the panels were removed, refit and do\nup the retainers.</p><p>Position the shield and secure it using\nthe bolts.</p><p><a href=\"#/3025960\">7210E10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025915\">7055B54</a></p>"]]